"""Approximate document-opening signals observed in training.

An initial 'def' gives a positive pulse; the colon in an initial 'Title:'
gives a large negative pulse. Other first-token values use boundary
markers, spacing, case and character type. All later positions receive
only a small background. Fine-grained lexical fluctuations are omitted.
